Error [E0080]: A braced callable with a non-unit success result needs `->` before its body.
  --> tests/ui/inline_module_return_type_mismatch.jet:15:23
    |
 15 | fn bad() bank.Account {
    |                       ^
 Why: the body arrow marks a declared success value; unit and unit-fallible callables keep bare braces.
 Fix: write `fn name(...) Type -> { ... }`; keep `fn name(...) { ... }` and `fn name(...) ! { ... }` bare.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0080

Error [E0113]: `bad` promises to return bank.Account, but this returns `vis2.bank.Account`
  --> tests/ui/inline_module_return_type_mismatch.jet:16:12
    |
 16 |     return vis2.bank.Account{balance: 1}
    |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: the value handed back must match the declared return type
 Fix: use bank.Account here
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0113
